{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now with 4 All New Mini-games</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flappy ship a Spaceship/gem themed flappy bird style mini-game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ship Survivor a type of Bullethell survive as long as you can mini-game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rhythm Gems a Fast paced reaction button press mini-game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin the Wheel and gain gems by collecting tickets by completing levels and playing the game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Protect the Galaxy with Crystal Power!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Gemspire: Incremental Invasion, you command a mystical gem-based civilization standing as the last line of defense against relentless alien invasions from the far future. This unique blend of incremental gameplay and tower defense strategy creates an addictive experience where every decision compounds over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystical vs. Technological</strong> Watch fantasy meet sci-fi as your crystal-powered defenses clash against advanced alien technology. Beautiful 2D art brings this epic conflict to life with stunning visual contrasts between magical gem structures and sleek futuristic invaders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Incremental Tower Defense</strong> Build and upgrade your crystalline towers while earning resources that carry over between waves. Your defenses grow stronger with each battle, allowing you to tackle increasingly challenging alien fleets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Depth</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct various gem-powered defense towers, each with unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research ancient magic to unlock powerful upgrades in your skill tree</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage resources to balance immediate needs with long-term growth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face diverse alien enemies requiring different tactical approaches</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Progression</strong> The alien threat never stops evolving. As your gem civilization grows in power, so do your extraterrestrial enemies. Can you protect the galaxy from this incremental invasion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the perfect fusion of strategic planning, resource management, and satisfying progression in this enchanting tower defense adventure!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Minute","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3890760/7631873bfb1cf47c49ffc8319c0463cb2c83b615.jpg"},{"name":"Getting Started","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3890760/7631873bfb1cf47c49ffc8319c0463cb2c83b615.jpg"},{"name":"Half Hour Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3890760/7631873bfb1cf47c49ffc8319c0463cb2c83b615.jpg"},{"name":"Hour Warrior","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3890760/7631873bfb1cf47c49ffc8319c0463cb2c83b615.jpg"},{"name":"Dedicated Player","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3890760/7631873bfb1cf47c49ffc8319c0463cb2c83b615.jpg"},{"name":"Master Player","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3890760/7631873bfb1cf47c49ffc8319c0463cb2c83b615.jpg"},{"name":"Menu Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3890760/7631873bfb1cf47c49ffc8319c0463cb2c83b615.jpg"},{"name":"First Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3890760/7631873bfb1cf47c49ffc8319c0463cb2c83b615.jpg"},{"name":"Veteran","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3890760/7631873bfb1cf47c49ffc8319c0463cb2c83b615.jpg"},{"name":"Elite","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3890760/7631873bfb1cf47c49ffc8319c0463cb2c83b615.jpg"}],"total":88},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3890760?t=1763465259","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3890760?t=1763465259","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890760/25873c2114e3bacbe68aca592d21c86b15ea1dd6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763465259","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890760/25873c2114e3bacbe68aca592d21c86b15ea1dd6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763465259","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now with 4 All New Mini-games</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flappy ship a Spaceship/gem themed flappy bird style mini-game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ship Survivor a type of Bullethell survive as long as you can mini-game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rhythm Gems a Fast paced reaction button press mini-game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin the Wheel and gain gems by collecting tickets by completing levels and playing the game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Protect the Galaxy with Crystal Power!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Gemspire: Incremental Invasion, you command a mystical gem-based civilization standing as the last line of defense against relentless alien invasions from the far future. This unique blend of incremental gameplay and tower defense strategy creates an addictive experience where every decision compounds over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystical vs. Technological</strong> Watch fantasy meet sci-fi as your crystal-powered defenses clash against advanced alien technology. Beautiful 2D art brings this epic conflict to life with stunning visual contrasts between magical gem structures and sleek futuristic invaders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Incremental Tower Defense</strong> Build and upgrade your crystalline towers while earning resources that carry over between waves. Your defenses grow stronger with each battle, allowing you to tackle increasingly challenging alien fleets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Depth</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct various gem-powered defense towers, each with unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research ancient magic to unlock powerful upgrades in your skill tree</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage resources to balance immediate needs with long-term growth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face diverse alien enemies requiring different tactical approaches</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Progression</strong> The alien threat never stops evolving. As your gem civilization grows in power, so do your extraterrestrial enemies. Can you protect the galaxy from this incremental invasion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the perfect fusion of strategic planning, resource management, and satisfying progression in this enchanting tower defense adventure!</p>","developers":["freshfocusgames"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890760/52d63908151bbd5fe145b2ebff8edeceb0021a56/header.jpg?t=17634652